This directory contains a collection of custom-built indicators developed in MQL5 for MetaTrader 5. Unlike built-in indicators, these tools are uniquely designed to visualize market data in innovative ways, offering more flexibility and customization for traders.

Each indicator in this collection:

Is built from scratch using MQL5

Serves a specific technical analysis purpose

Can be used for both manual trading and automation

New indicators will be added over time as I experiment with new ideas and strategies.
